  <h2>5. Recommendation &amp; Governance Next Steps</h2>
  <p><strong>Action:</strong> Adopt standard SAP Fiori elements application Manage Purchase Orders (F0842A) as primary modern successor for classic transaction ME21N.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Basis Team: Activate Gateway service MM_PUR_PO_MAINT_V2_SRV in Client 200.</li>
    <li>Security Team: Assign SAP_BR_PURCHASER to procurement personnel in FLP Content Manager.</li>
    <li>Functional Team: Execute UAT comparing account-assignment lines against legacy ME21N.</li>
